# Omnichat Clean Code Rule

Ap dung rule nay cho moi session moi trong repository nay.

## Bat buoc truoc khi code

- Doc file `refs/docs/AI_CLEAN_CODE_RULES.md` va tuan thu day du.
- Neu co xung dot, uu tien quy tac trong file tren.

## Quy tac thuc thi

- Khong tao file `util` chung chung cho business flow.
- Dat constants/enums/interfaces dung domain folder.
- Middleware va filter phai tach bach trach nhiem, cau hinh qua `ConfigService`.
- Moi env key moi phai cap nhat dong bo vao `.env.example`.
- Khong dung naming domain ngoai Omnichat (vi du: crm, shop) neu khong duoc yeu cau ro rang.
- Sau thay doi lon, luon build/type-check va sua het loi phat sinh.

## Cach tra loi uu tien

- De xuat theo huong clean architecture, de doc, de bao tri.
- Neu co nhieu cach lam, uu tien pattern da ton tai trong codebase nay.
